297
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:03,000
who else can

298
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:03,919
tell me what to do?

299
00:14:05,240 --> 00:14:05,840
Then I

300
00:14:06,480 --> 00:14:07,519
can destroy this body

301
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:09,080
before that.

302
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,200
Do you want to try?

303
00:14:21,080 --> 00:14:21,600
I know

304
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,679
you really like her.

305
00:14:27,200 --> 00:14:28,519
But before you ascend to the throne

306
00:14:28,840 --> 00:14:30,000
and solidify your position,

307
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:32,360
you should keep her safe

308
00:14:32,480 --> 00:14:33,320
and let her live well.

309
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:34,840
Don't let her get involved

310
00:14:34,879 --> 00:14:35,840
in those dirty things.

311
00:14:37,279 --> 00:14:38,159
After that,

312
00:14:40,240 --> 00:14:41,799
if you can win her heart,

313
00:14:43,080 --> 00:14:43,840
it will be

314
00:14:47,039 --> 00:14:48,279
your destiny.

315
00:14:50,799 --> 00:14:51,840
You're sensible.

316
00:14:52,840 --> 00:14:53,759
One last thing,

317
00:14:56,759 --> 00:14:58,679
do your best to be a good emperor.

318
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,039
This country

319
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,799
was built with countless lives.

320
00:15:04,039 --> 00:15:05,519
You hate that I was unfair to you,

321
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,080
but the people are innocent.

322
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,440
Don't lecture me.

323
00:15:09,879 --> 00:15:10,840
You can do it.

324
00:15:12,000 --> 00:15:12,639
Shen Li

325
00:15:13,639 --> 00:15:14,639
and those loyal ministers

326
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:16,639
will all

327
00:15:16,799 --> 00:15:17,879
assist you well.

328
00:15:18,679 --> 00:15:19,840
Do you trust me so much?

329
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:25,960
You are me, and I am you.

330
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,360
If I don't trust you,

331
00:15:29,639 --> 00:15:30,360
who can I trust?

332
00:15:34,840 --> 00:15:35,440
Yue Xuan,

333
00:15:37,080 --> 00:15:38,399
live well for me.

334
00:15:41,759 --> 00:15:42,600
Take care of her

335
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,240
for me.

336
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,279
Don't worry.

337
00:15:52,840 --> 00:15:53,559
I know.

338
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:55,320
Don't talk too much.

339
00:15:56,759 --> 00:15:57,600
Take a good rest.

340
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:00,519
You can live two more months.

341
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:04,840
Silly boy.
